  "longBusinessSummary": "AnchorCore SE operates as a European investment holding company which, through its subsidiaries, engages in the design, installation, service, and maintenance of building management systems (BMS) and building energy management systems in the United Kingdom. The company offers on-site provision of BMS installation, maintenance, upgrades, repairs, and on-site optimization; remote and energy services, such as monitor, fix, and optimize buildings remotely through secure connections; and unified BMS, smartphone app, and other technology propositions. It also provides associated bureau services. The company serves healthcare, data centres, retail, transport, commercial, public sector, education, military, industrial, and leisure sectors. AnchorCore SE was formerly known as learnd SE and changed its name to AnchorCore SE in July 2026. AnchorCore SE was founded in 2020 and is headquartered in Luxembourg, Luxembourg.",
